## STEP 13 : SAVE FILE

Press:
CTRL + O

Press:
Enter

Press:
CTRL + X

Purpose:
Saves and exits the nano editor.

## STEP 14 : RESTART NGINX

Command:
sudo systemctl restart nginx

Purpose:
Reloads Nginx server with updated website changes.

## STEP 15 : OPEN WEBSITE IN BROWSER

Open:

http://YOUR_PUBLIC_IP

Example:

http://20.2.83.37

Purpose:
Accesses the publicly hosted static website from the internet.

========================================
AZURE NETWORK CONFIGURATION
===========================

In Azure Portal:

VM → Networking

Allow Inbound Ports:

1. Port 22 → SSH
2. Port 80 → HTTP

========================================
IMPORTANT PATHS
===============

Website Directory:
/var/www/html

Main Webpage:
/var/www/html/index.html

